                    {
                        "sense_id": "74d1f531-7079-3915-8181-866b92084493",
                        "entry_id": "acdf05b9-ee76-32a7-9d7f-162660f73d94",
                        "glosses": [
                            "to start talking or speaking about one thing repeatedly, to get hung up on something"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "colloquial"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "13403fec-4736-486a-a146-6576509d2458",
                                "sense_id": "74d1f531-7079-3915-8181-866b92084493",
                                "text": "– ... Но попо́мните, что на нулево́м ци́кле у нас рабо́тают то́лько доброво́льно. Лу́чшие на́ши рабо́чие — доброво́льцы.\n— Попо́мню, — сказа́л молодо́й челове́к, кладя́ тру́бку […]\n«Заци́клился старика́н на свои́х доброво́льцах», — поду́мал он.",
                                "translation": "\"Remember, though, that only volunteers work at the initial point of the cycle. They're our best workers, the volunteers.\"\n\"I'll remember,” the young man said. He put down the receiver […] \"The old man's obsessed with his volunteers,\" he thought.",
                                "english": "\"Remember, though, that only volunteers work at the initial point of the cycle. They're our best workers, the volunteers.\"\n\"I'll remember,” the young man said. He put down the receiver […] \"The old man's obsessed with his volunteers,\" he thought."
                            }
                        ]
